      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are four concise NPC profiles for your urban RPG script:\n\n**1. The CEO**\n Mara Vance runs a tech conglomerate from a glass-walled penthouse, constantly multitasking between a luxury lunch date and a toxic stock exchange meeting. She is sharp, dismissive of the \"lower life,\" and rarely suffers from typical physical ailments due to a personal health retainer, making her an intimidating yet fascinating lead to interact with in high-stakes scenarios.\n\n**2. The Sleeper**\nJules watches the rain slicked rain reflect the city lights out of the corner of his eye, deliberately avoiding any disturbance to stay out of a racketeer's net. His necklaces of junk are his only defense, and if you ask him questions, he will give you the truth. He knows everyone and everything, but will take a fixed toll or turn a blind eye never to be seen.\n\n**3. The Neighbor**\nMrs. Gable is an elderly librarian who lives in a weathered two-bedroom apartment on the other side of the brick wall; she's always welcoming and will always offer a homemade cup of tea. She remembers the names of every resident in the community and knows the local gossip better than anyone else.",
